{"unit_id":"DeZhou123__dsh-model-orchestrator#card-zh","repo":"DeZhou123/dsh-model-orchestrator","commit":"80ec93a43ad09332417ec8bd3b48e996d37e5a0f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-orchestrator 是面向 DSH Web 的模型路由插件，先按模型能力和策略选模型，再从该模型可用的渠道中挑选线路。它在 DSH 请求流程中覆盖实际 provider、model 和推理档位，并在失败时优先重试同一模型的其他渠道，所有渠道不可用后再切换模型。主要功能包括质量、均衡、省 token 和速度策略，偏好模型模式，渠道健康与请求用量观测，以及状态面板和 agent 工具。适合配置了多个模型或渠道、希望自动选择并在限流或故障时继续请求的 DSH 用户。无需额外 API key；可选读取本机 channel-pack 与 our-free-model 状态文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1537-1567","src/router.js:602-641","src/tools.js:36-56","client.js:1-20","src/channels.js:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"DeZhou123__dsh-model-orchestrator#card-en","repo":"DeZhou123/dsh-model-orchestrator","commit":"80ec93a43ad09332417ec8bd3b48e996d37e5a0f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Route DSH Web requests by model and channel health. It chooses a model using the configured strategy, retries another channel after failures, and changes models when needed. A preferred-model mode, health and usage panel, and agent controls are included. Local channel files add routing signals.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1537-1567","src/router.js:602-641","src/tools.js:36-56","client.js:1-20","src/channels.js:1-20"]}
