{"unit_id":"DeZhou123__dsh-model-orchestrator#feature-1","repo":"DeZhou123/dsh-model-orchestrator","commit":"80ec93a43ad09332417ec8bd3b48e996d37e5a0f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-orchestrator 的功能「模型与渠道自动路由」：根据策略和可用性选择模型及其渠道。请求失败时先尝试同一模型的其他渠道，模型组不可用后再重新选模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/router.js:602-642","index.js:1558-1564"]}
